  "description": "HttpClient extensions that return Result<T> instead of throwing. Maps HTTP 4xx/5xx status codes to typed REslava.Result domain errors (NotFoundError, UnauthorizedError, ForbiddenError, ConflictError, ValidationError) and wraps network exceptions in ExceptionError. Designed for Railway-Oriented pipelines — chain BindAsync, Map, Ensure directly on HTTP responses. Configurable via HttpResultOptions.",
